# T5i: FM6 and NOISE as engine-only parts (PART_FM6 = 4, PART_NOISE = 5), played through the
# C_BON / C_BOFF command path. A 4-note FM6 chord, then a NOISE hit; the events golden fixes the
# command stream and audio.json fixes the level (not silent, no clipping).
wait 300
# the mix strips: FM6 and NOISE at unity (T_MIX voices 4 and 5)
param 5 4 0 100
param 5 5 0 100
# FM6: the TINE EP factory voice (SLOT=0), its level macro up a little
param 3 0 7 0
param 3 0 2 70
# NOISE: ANLG, bright and resonant
param 3 1 0 0
param 3 1 2 90
param 3 1 4 0
events ev.txt
wav t5i.wav
note 4 60 110
note 4 64 110
note 4 67 110
note 4 72 110
wait 500
note 5 45 120
wait 500
note 4 60 0
note 4 64 0
note 4 67 0
note 4 72 0
note 5 45 0
wait 1500
eventsstop
wavstop
expect peak_db_min -40
expect peak_db_max -0.2
